      "message": "[error] Line 168: 🔴 `releasePendingFrame()` is called **after** the null-`avframe` early return. If a previous direct-render request left `pendingFrame_` set (and locks held), a subsequent null-buffer callback returns here without releasing those locks, potentially leaving `renderersMutex_`/`frameMutex` locked indefinitely on that thread. Move `releasePendingFrame()` before the null check (or call it in the null branch) so stale locks are always released.",
      "revId": "861753107a87ca370684e5be94d0287ed0f62cc1",
