      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 76: 🟡 `pendingFrame_` is declared `static thread_local`, so it is shared by all `VideoProvider` instances on the same thread. If more than one instance exists, one instance may release or assume ownership of another instance’s pending frame/locks, which is undefined behavior. Track pending state per-instance-per-thread (e.g., thread-local map keyed by `this`, or store both owner pointer and frame pointer and validate owner before releasing).",
